Mount and Blade Warband Savegame Editor

Based on information from M&B Warband Modding Wiki[1] and Mount and Blade Warband Module System[2][3].

[1] http://mbmodwiki.ollclan.eu/, http://mbmodwiki.ollclan.eu/Savegame; archive: https://mbmodwiki.github.io/Savegame

[2] https://forums.taleworlds.com/index.php?threads/warband-modders-download-repository.326973/,

[3] Community version (with annotations): https://forums.taleworlds.com/index.php?threads/warband-module-system-1-166-with-tweaks-and-giggles.324874/

The `data` package can be considered a standalone package that provides loading and saving functionality as well as models for structures within the savegame.

The `main` package will be used by me, the repository owner, to implement certain features. Feel free to use it as an example by replacing the filename within `main.go` and running `go run .` from within the project.